<title>USA: RT Industries to merge with Quality.</title>
<headline>RT Industries to merge with Quality.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>RT Industries Inc said Tuesday it has agreed to merge with Quality Automotive Company Inc, a privately held manufacturer of friction materials and brake pads and a re-manufacturer of automotive brake shoes.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>RT, a manufacturer and distributor of automotive brake pads, said it will conduct future operations under the name U.S. Automotive Manufacturing Inc.</p>
<p>RT said last year that it was actively seeking acquisitions.</p>
</text>
